    <string name="disclaimer_footer_notice">Isɣewwaren-a ttaken anekcum kan ɣer tmahilin yellan deg firmware asli n yibenk. Ur sɛin ara isefka n useɣẓan n tmeẓla, ur ttbeddilen ara ula d yiwen.</string>
