    <string name="disclaimer_miravision_message">Isɣewwaren-a rran-ten imnadiyen n temɣiwant LineageOS. Ur sɛin ara assaɣ akked MediaTek neɣ Lenovo, ur ttwasenɛaten neɣ ttwasiregen ara seg-sent.\n\nAsesfer n tugniwin yettwaxedem s yiferdisen n tmeẓla n MediaTek i d-yeddan akked yibenk. Isɣewwaren-a seqdacen kan tifyar i d-sseknen yakan yiferdisen-nni; ur ten-sɛin ara, ur ten-bḍun ara neɣ beddilen-tent ara.\n\nIgmaḍ zemren ad mgarraden ɣef firmware asli. Tameẓla-a tettunefk akka am akken, war garantit n yal tawsit; seqdec-itt s uɛeṭṭer-ik.\n\nAkk tizmilin d ayla n yimawlan-nsent.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_dolby_message">Isɣewwaren-a rran-ten imnadiyen n temɣiwant LineageOS. Ur sɛin ara assaɣ akked Dolby Laboratories neɣ Lenovo, ur ttwasenɛaten neɣ ttwasiregen ara seg-sent.\n\nAsesfer n imesli yettwaxedem s yiferdisen n tmeẓla n Dolby i d-yeddan akked yibenk. Isɣewwaren-a seqdacen kan tifyar i d-sseknen yakan yiferdisen-nni; ur ten-sɛin ara, ur ten-bḍun ara neɣ beddilen-tent ara.\n\nIgmaḍ zemren ad mgarraden ɣef firmware asli. Tameẓla-a tettunefk akka am akken, war garantit n yal tawsit; seqdec-itt s uɛeṭṭer-ik.\n\nAkk tizmilin d ayla n yimawlan-nsent.</string>
